              },
              "block": [
                {
                  "text": "“Cats!” Marcel looks at the Mona Lisa. His eyes are two big saucers. “But cats kill mice,” he thinks. “They eat them. And where are we going in Italy? Rome? Milan? Naples? ...” But at that moment Antoine puts the bag under the seat. “Now I really can’t hear,” Marcel thinks. Then he goes to sleep and has a very bad dream."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
